    "chunk_text": "Staff Conference 2026 HNB Life celebrates 25-year journey, exceptional success\n\nHNB Life brought together the employees from across the island for its 2026 Staff Conference, a memorable gala evening held as part of the company\u2019s 25th anniversary celebrations.\n\nThe event marked not only a milestone year in the organisation\u2019s journey but also celebrated one of the most successful years in the company\u2019s history, recognising the people and teams who continue to drive HNB Life forward.\n\nThe evening was a celebration of the extraordinary progress achieved during the past year, which saw HNB Life reach new heights across business performance, customer engagement and industry recognition.\n\nWhile the achievements were remarkable, the focus of the event remained firmly on the people behind the success, the employees whose dedication and belief in the company\u2019s purpose have helped shape its journey.\n\nExecutive Director and CEO Lasitha Wimalaratne said, \u201cAs we celebrate 25 years of our journey, it is important to remember that our greatest achievement has always been our people.\u201d\n\nEVP and Chief People Officer Navin Rupasinghe said, \u201cThis evening is about celebrating the people who make HNB Life what it is.\u201d"
