    "chunk_text": "BestWeb.LK 2026 crowns best websites\n\nLK Domain Registry CEO and Domain Registrar Prof. Gihan Dias\n\nLK Domain Registry marked 16 years of the BestWeb.LK Awards, Sri Lanka\u2019s national web competition and benchmark for digital excellence, at a grand award ceremony held at Monarch Imperial recently.\n\nThe event was graced by the presence of the chief guest Secretary to Prime Minister Pradeep Saputhanthri, who presented the Gold, Silver and Bronze awards for the Best Overall Websites, while several distinguished guests were also present at the occasion.\n\nLK Domain Registry was represented by Chairman Indika De Zoysa and Director, CEO and Domain Registrar Prof. Gihan Dias, together with several other members of the organisation.\n\nDuring the event, a total of 106 awards were presented across 24 categories, recognising the outstanding achievements in Sri Lanka\u2019s digital landscape. The Overall Gold Award was won by homelandsskyline.lk, while parliament.lk was presented with the Overall Silver and jatholdings.lk received the Overall Bronze.\n\nIn recognition of their outstanding talent in web development, 3CS was awarded Best Web Developer \u2013 Gold, followed by Web Lankan (Pvt.) Ltd with Silver and Shanika Rajapaksha with Bronze."
