    "chunk_text": "Building on this strong foundation, SLCHPA 2026 will be bigger and better, with a renewed focus on recognising more organisations, showcasing innovative workplace initiatives and creating greater value for participating companies. The Awards will provide businesses with an opportunity to benchmark their practices, gain national recognition and demonstrate their commitment towards creating workplaces where employees can thrive.\n\nTo ensure that the Awards maintain credibility and recognise genuine workplace excellence, the SLCHPA 2026 evaluation process will follow a structured and transparent approach.\n\nWith applications and registrations for SLCHPA 2026 opening soon, organizations of all sizes and sectors are invited to participate in this platform."
