    "chunk_size_bytes": 1760,
    "chunk_text": "Groundworth launches \u2018The Highway\u2019 land development near Kottawa Expressway Interchange\n\nGroundworth (Pvt.) Ltd has launched \u2018The Highway by Groundworth\u2019, an exclusive land development located just 1 km from the Kottawa Expressway Interchange, offering premium residential plots with convenient access to the Southern Expressway (E01) and Outer Circular Expressway (E02).\n\nPositioned inside an established and rapidly developing residential corridor, The Highway offers residents easy access to Colombo, Galle, Matara, Kadawatha and Katunayake, while keeping essential amenities, schools, healthcare and public transport close by. The development\u2019s proximity to High Level Road (A4) also provides an additional connection between Pannipitiya and Colombo.\n\nGroundworth Group Managing Director and Co-Founder Kasun Andrahennadi stated, \u201cWe wanted to create an opportunity where the location does much of the work in defining the value of the property. The Highway is built around one of the strongest practical advantages a property can offer: connectivity. Being just 1 km from the Kottawa Expressway Interchange means our customers can connect quickly to key destinations across the island while still having schools, healthcare, transport, and everyday conveniences close to home.\u201d\n\nThe Highway comprises only 12 plots, with land sizes beginning from six perches. Clear deeds, 22-ft road frontage, pipe-borne water and electricity connections, and a planned residential environment are all aspects of the development, which is intended for those looking to build high-end homes in a well-connected location. Land prices start from Rs.2.1 million per perch.\n\nThe Highway is now open for site visits, with only a limited number of plots available."
  },
