    "description": "CA Sri Lanka submits comprehensive proposals for National Budget 2027",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/CA-Sri-Lanka-submits-comprehensive-proposals-for-National-Budget-2027/273-350391",
    "lang": "en",
