    "description": "Children\u2019s Homes & Donations:  - The Wall Between Donors and Children",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Childrens-Homes-Donations-The-Wall-Between-Donors-and-Children/172-350402",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
