    "md5": "aa633d74eed5ddfb21f2fa86122bd12d",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 784,
    "chunk_text": "Court issues warrants for Aravinda de Silva and wife\n\nColombo, Sep. 16 (Daily Mirror) - Colombo Fort Magistrate Pasan Amarasena today issued warrants for the arrest of former cricketer Aravinda de Silva and his wife, Priyanga Anushka Wijenayake.\n\nThe order was made when the case against Kapila and his wife was taken up before the Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court today, as Aravinda de Silva and his wife, who had stood as sureties for Kapila Chandrasena\u2019s wife, failed to appear in court.\n\nCounsel appearing for them submitted that they were unable to appear in court as Aravinda de Silva\u2019s mother had passed away and her funeral was scheduled to be held today.\n\nThe Magistrate said that this fact should be brought to the court\u2019s attention when the warrants are taken up for recall."
  },
  {
