    "description": "\u2019Positive sign for Indian investments in Colombo Port City\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Positive-sign-for-Indian-investments-in-Colombo-Port-City/108-350433",
    "lang": "en",
