    "chunk_text": "The shift towards becoming a trusted strategic adviser is one of the key themes identified by Rise2040, a profession-wide research initiative launched by AICPA and CIMA. The initiative brings together 6,000 insights from across the globe to collectively explore, challenge and shape the future of public accounting and finance.\n\nFor Sri Lanka, this evolution could hardly be more timely. As the country continues its economic recovery and reform journey, businesses and policymakers need more than an accurate account of the past. They need finance professionals who can anticipate change, assess risk, identify opportunities and connect financial insight to long-term strategy. Sri Lanka has a deep and growing pool of finance and accounting talent. The opportunity now is to harness that talent not only to support recovery, but to help shape the country\u2019s next chapter of sustainable growth.\n\nBy embracing the continued evolution of our profession, we can move from being the business partners of today to becoming the trusted strategic advisers of tomorrow, helping lead our organisations successfully into the future."
