    "md5": "7dc2d9b4456a75c1e796a4848c170a08",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1133,
    "chunk_text": "Ocean Lanka marks 30 years in apparel industry\n\nOcean Lanka (Pvt) Ltd, a weft knitted fabric manufacture, marks its 30th anniversary this year. Since its establishment in 1996, the company has evolved alongside Sri Lanka\u2019s apparel industry, continuously strengthening its manufacturing capabilities and building long-standing relationships with customers, partners and stakeholders.\u00a0 Over three decades, the company has navigated changing global market conditions, technological advancements and evolving customer expectations, while maintaining a strong focus on quality, reliability and continuous improvement. Innovation has remained an important pillar of this journey. Through continued investment in research and development, product innovation, technology and operational excellence, Ocean Lanka has strengthened its ability to develop functional and performancedriven fabric solutions for increasingly sophisticated global requirements. Its work in textile research and commercialisation has also received national recognition, reinforcing the company\u2019s ambition to compete through innovation and greater value creation."
