    "chunk_text": "DIMO unveils all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026\n\nThe all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 was unveiled by DIMO at the inaugural Sri Lanka Tennis Premier League 2026, which concluded recently.\n\nAs Mercedes-Benz celebrates 140 years of innovation, the introduction of the all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 reflects the brand\u2019s continued commitment to innovation, intelligent mobility and the evolving needs of its customers around the world.\n\nPositioned under the theme \u2018Own Your New World\u2019, the all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 is designed with families in mind, built for those who value space, flexibility and everyday practicality without compromising on the Mercedes-Benz lifestyle and comfort.\n\nThe third row of seats transforms it into a comfortable seven-seater, while the rear seats slide forward and back with individually adjustable backrests, giving families the right balance between passenger comfort and luggage space, even with bulky items such as prams or sports gear on board.\n\nThe all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 design is equally distinctive. Its confident SUV stance is complemented by daytime running lights shaped like the Mercedes star and tail lamps with a signature light animation, making the vehicle instantly recognisable, day or night.\n\nThe all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 multimedia system allows the passengers to stream music and video on the vehicle\u2019s screens, keeping everyone entertained on longer journeys.\n\nThe all-new Mercedes-Benz GLB 2026 pairs a four-cylinder petrol engine with a 48V hybrid system, delivering strong everyday performance with greater fuel efficiency."
