    "chunk_text": "Union Bank CEO Dilshan Rodrigo appointed as SLID Senior Vice Chairman\n\nUnion Bank Director and Chief Executive Officer Dilshan Rodrigo has been re-elected as Senior Vice Chairman of the Sri Lanka Institute of Directors (SLID) for the second consecutive year. The appointment was confirmed at the institute\u2019s Annual General Meeting held recently.\u00a0 A dedicated and active member of the SLID who previously served as Vice Chairman, Rodrigo\u2019s continued leadership underscores his profound impact and ongoing contributions to corporate governance, excellence and the wider corporate sector in Sri Lanka."
