    "chunk_size_bytes": 613,
    "chunk_text": "Actor Vishwa Kodikara fined Rs. 5,000 over cocaine possession\n\nColombo, September 17 (Daily Mirror)- Film and teledrama actor Vishwa Kodikara was fined Rs. 5,000 by Mount Lavinia Magistrate Kanchana Neranjala Silva after he pleaded guilty to possessing cocaine.\n\nThe Magistrate reprimanded Kodikara and warned that he would be referred for rehabilitation if he was involved in a similar offence in the future.\n\nWellawatta Police arrested Kodikara and four others during a raid on a restaurant in the Wellawatta beach area yesterday.\n\nThe suspects were produced before the Mount Lavinia Magistrate\u2019s Court today."
