    "chunk_size_bytes": 604,
    "chunk_text": "Three-wheeler driver dies after Dematagoda shooting\n\nColombo, September 17 (Daily Mirror) - A three-wheeler driver who was injured in a shooting incident near the \u2018Kalu Palama\u2019 in Dematagoda this evening has succumbed to his injuries while receiving treatment in hospital, police said.\n\nThe shooting was reported earlier today (17), and the victim was rushed to hospital following the incident.\n\nHowever, police later confirmed that the three-wheeler driver had died while undergoing treatment.\n\nFurther investigations are underway to identify the gunman and establish the motive behind the shooting."
  },
