    "description": "Sri Lanka can become an energy-security hub \u2014 if it stops thinking like a supply-chain endpoint",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Sri-Lanka-can-become-an-energy-security-hub-if-it-stops-thinking-like-a-supply-chain-endpoint/4-797399",
