    "chunk_size_bytes": 1180,
    "chunk_text": "Payments.lk is intended for more than established companies. The platform is designed for start-ups, SMEs, online sellers, freelancers, entrepreneurs and licensed professionals, giving a much broader segment of the market access to digital payments.\n\nDoctors, lawyers, accountants, consultants and other eligible professionals can also apply using their professional registration.\n\nWhile Payments.lk is a new platform, the infrastructure behind it is already operating at scale. Payable\u2019s payment infrastructure serves more than 40,000 merchants across Sri Lanka and has processed over Rs.145 billion in card payments to date. This allows Payments.lk to combine the simplicity and economics of a modern technology platform with proven payments infrastructure, banking integrations and merchant operations.\n\nThe company sees Payments.lk as more than simply another gateway. It is being built as a set of modern payment rails that can increasingly connect payments with QR, point-of-sale, invoicing, ERP, payroll, lending and working capital.\n\nEstablished in 2016, Payable is focused on enabling businesses to accept digital payments through modern and scalable payment solutions."
