    "md5": "1c7bb5d3c762a21018e6739b572e683e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1814,
    "chunk_text": "Rush City \u2013 Phase 1 unveiled in Colombo\n\nSets new benchmark for affordable premium living in heart of Colombo\n\nRush Lanka Group, a trusted Sri Lankan property developer with over three decades of experience in creating quality residential developments, has unveiled Rush City \u2013 Phase 01, an exciting new residential project set to redefine affordable premium living in Colombo.\n\nBringing together contemporary architecture, premium lifestyle amenities and a prime location in Dematagoda, Colombo 9, just 300 metres from Baseline Road, Rush City offers the residents seamless connectivity to Colombo\u2019s key business districts, leading schools, hospitals, transport networks and everyday conveniences.\n\nFeaturing over 400 thoughtfully designed modern apartments within a carefully planned community, the development blends smart space utilisation, contemporary design and everyday functionality to create an ideal urban lifestyle for young professionals, growing families, first-time homeowners and investors seeking long-term value in one of Colombo\u2019s fastest-growing locations.\n\nWhat truly sets Rush City apart is its promise of \u2018premium living made affordable\u2019. The development seamlessly combines the comfort, convenience and lifestyle amenities typically found in high-end residential communities, including landscaped gardens, recreational spaces, family-friendly facilities, fitness and wellness areas and vibrant community spaces, all thoughtfully designed to deliver an elevated living experience where the residents can enjoy an elevated standard of living without compromising on affordability.\n\nComplementing its lifestyle offering are flexible payment options that make owning a home easier and more accessible for first-time buyers, young professionals, growing families and investors alike."
