    "chunk_text": "\u201cWith Duality, we set out to honor the gap between the everyday essentials we rely on and the statement art pieces that elevate special moments. By pairing hand painted artisanal teak designs alongside everyday luxury items like work-ready laptop sleeves, structured laptop bags, and sleek leather wallets, this collection ensures you never have to choose between utility and craftsmanship,\u201d said SafraAnver, Marketing Director at Ma Fiert\u00e9.\n\n\u201cEvery single item in this collection is artisan led, handcrafted by talented makers within marginalised communities. Launching Duality at Isle of Rataa is not just about sharing versatile, beautifully constructed leather and teak pieces; it\u2019s about creating sustainable opportunities for the hands that made them,\u201d she added.\n\nThe collection reflects Ma Fiert\u00e9\u2019s wider philosophy of creating lasting, meaningful products through honest craftsmanship and natural materials."
