    "chunk_text": "Climate change is not merely an environmental issue. It is fundamentally a challenge to food security, health, economic development, biodiversity, and human wellbeing. The solutions exist within science, innovation, and collective action. The task before us is to transform knowledge into action before the window of opportunity closes.\n\n(Prof. Saman Seneweera, of the University of Melbourne, explores the defining of climate challenges in this decade and the shifting global strategies framework required to meet them. He is an internationally renowned plant scientist and a leading academic who has been exploring and researching climate change phenomena \u2013 locally and internationally)"
