    "chunk_text": "Four missing after entering Ma Oya in Badalgama\n\nColombo, Sep.19 (Daily Mirror) - Four people who had gone to bathe in the Ma Oya in the Badalgama area have gone missing, police said.\n\nThe missing persons include three women and one man, all reportedly around 25 years of age.\n\nPolice, together with local residents, have launched a search operation to locate the missing individuals."
