    "md5": "a023752c2c398a1527611a8f2dceafb5",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1259,
    "chunk_text": "Trump bans CNN, MSNBC and Politico from White House over \u2018fake news\u2019\n\nWashington- U.S. President Donald Trump said he has banned CNN, MSNOW and Politico from the White House, accusing the media outlets of repeatedly publishing what he called \u201cfake news.\u201d\n\nIn a post on his official X account, Trump said the ban was effective immediately and accused the three outlets of reporting \u201cfiction and lies\u201d about his administration and the United States.\n\nTrump referred to CNN as \u201cFake News CNN\u201d and claimed that MSNOW had recently changed its name from MSNBC due to a lack of \u201cviewership and credibility.\u201d\n\nHe also accused Politico of receiving an $8 million subscription from the U.S. government under former President Joe Biden, describing the payment as \u201cillegal and ridiculous\u201d and alleging that it amounted to corruption.\n\n\u201cMedia Outlets shouldn\u2019t be able to constantly write or report FICTION and LIES when they\u2019re covering the President of the United States, the Trump Administration, or the United States of America,\u201d Trump said.\n\nHe added that other media outlets could also face similar action.\n\n\u201cOther Fake News Media Outlets to follow,\u201d Trump said in the post, which he signed off as \u201cPresident DONALD J. TRUMP.\u201d"
  },
