    "chunk_size_bytes": 726,
    "chunk_text": "Landslide blocks Hatton-Bagawantalawa Road\n\nColombo, Sep. 20 (Daily Mirror) - A large earth mound has collapsed onto the Hatton-Bagawantalawa-Maskeliya-Balangoda road at Wanraja Estate in Dikoya, completely disrupting traffic along the route amid heavy rainfall in the Hatton area.\n\nThe landslide occurred at around 11.00 a.m. today (20), and Hatton Police, together with residents, have commenced clearing the earth from the road.\n\nPolice said the Road Development Authority has also been informed to deploy machinery and expedite the removal of the earth.\n\nAs there is a further risk of landslides at the location, Hatton Police have urged motorists travelling along the affected section of road to exercise extreme caution."
  },
