    "chunk_text": "From creators and entrepreneurs to marketers, technology leaders and business professionals, Digital Summit Asia aims to create new conversations and connections that extend beyond the two-day event.\n\nThe programme has been designed to move beyond conventional conference formats, with two days of keynotes, interactive sessions, breakout rooms, workshops, roundtable discussions and panel conversations.\n\nThe Summit brings together perspectives from across a wide range of industries and digital disciplines, including FinTech, MarTech, travel and tourism, retail, technology, media, advertising, e-commerce, data analytics and AI.\n\nA dedicated set of sessions will also explore the intersection of digital, travel and tourism, creatingan opportunity for professionals from the travel and tourism ecosystem to engage directly with the digital and creative communities shaping how destinations, hospitality brands and experiences connect with audiences."
