    "md5": "bf02bf29b767fe38a453e0984d39302a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 939,
    "chunk_text": "\u201cHundreds of thousands of Sri Lankans work overseas to create a better future for their families. Their earnings support their loved ones and make an important contribution to the national economy. Through Ethera Diriya, we want to help them convert that effort into a secure home and an asset that will serve their families for years,\u201d said Pinnaduwa.\n\nTogether, the Ethera Diriya housing loan scheme, DFCC RataViru savings account and the bank\u2019s remittance services support the migrant workers at different stages of their financial journey, from sending and saving money to investing in a home.\n\nThe initiative recognises that the value of remittances should be measured not only by the money entering the country but also by what that money makes possible for families. A home can provide stability today, create an asset for the future and give greater meaning to the sacrifices made by those working away from their loved ones."
