    "description": "Sivarasa Anojan:  Sri Lanka must not lose another citizen",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/news-features/Sivarasa-Anojan-Sri-Lanka-must-not-lose-another-citizen/131-350763",
    "lang": "en",
