    "description": "\u201cViYASA\u201d National Business Facilitation Centre to open tomorrow",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/ViYASA-National-Business-Facilitation-Centre-to-open-tomorrow/108-350801",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
