    "chunk_text": "Type-C USB connectivity provides added flexibility for internet access across laptops, tablets, smartphones and other Wi-Fi-enabled devices. The launch further strengthens Dialog\u2019s position as Sri Lanka\u2019s leading eSIM innovator. Building on pioneering services such as eSIM One Number and eSIM Quick Transfer, Dialog continues to make connected experiences simpler, smarter and more seamless for the customers.\n\nDialog 5G MiFi works seamlessly with the Dialog Ultra plans, including Dialog Ultra 1495, 1895, 2595, 2995 and 3999. These plans enable the customers to enjoy Dialog 5G Ultra connectivity where available, with continued connectivity over 4G.\n\nDialog 5G Ultra MiFi, with eSIM, is priced at Rs.39,990 and is available via www.dialog.lk and selected Dialog outlets, with easy payment plans of up to 60 months available through leading credit card partners.\n\nThe customers purchasing the device in-store at selected Dialog outlets can also enjoy applicable Club Vision discounts. For more information, visit https://dialog.lk/accessories/dialog-5g-ultra-mifi-mf511."
