    "chunk_text": "LOLC Finance Chief Operating Officer Montini Warnakula said, \u201cThis partnership with Continental Cars reflects our commitment to providing the customers with greater choice, convenience and value. By combining our flexible financing solutions with the strength of the Volkswagen brand, we are creating an attractive proposition for the customers while expanding opportunities within Sri Lanka\u2019s automotive and financial services sectors.\u201d\n\nContinental Cars Deputy Chairman Charu Senavirathna added, \u201cVolkswagen has long been recognised for its distinctive blend of German engineering, sophisticated design, performance and premium quality. Our partnership with LOLC Finance further strengthens the value proposition for the customers by making the Volkswagen experience more accessible through attractive financing solutions and exclusive benefits. We believe this collaboration will enable more customers across Sri Lanka to experience the prestige and confidence associated with owning a Volkswagen, while enjoying greater convenience and value throughout their purchase journey.\u201d\n\nThe collaboration represents a strategic step towards delivering greater value and convenience to the customers while strengthening ties between Sri Lanka\u2019s financial services and automotive sectors."
