    "description": "Understanding Sri Lanka\u2019s startup funding ladder and why the right capital matters",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Understanding-Sri-Lanka-s-startup-funding-ladder-and-why-the-right-capital-matters/4-797621",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
