    "description": "Ambeon Capital partners Indian firms to open India-Sri Lanka investment desks, launch dedicated fund",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Ambeon-Capital-partners-Indian-firms-to-open-India-Sri-Lanka-investment-desks-launch-dedicated-fund/34-797635",
    "lang": "en",
