    "description": "Capital Gains Tax takes sharp turn: What  Sri Lanka\u2019s new 2026 rates mean for investors",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Capital-Gains-Tax-takes-sharp-turn-What-Sri-Lanka-s-new-2026-rates-mean-for-investors/4-797664",
