    "description": "Parliament approves Rs. 17.2 b for  electricity relief",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Parliament-approves-Rs-17-2-b-for-electricity-relief/34-797684",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
