    "chunk_text": "Security tightened around Parliament amid 22nd Amendment debate\n\nColombo, September 24 (Daily Mirror)- Security has been tightened in and around the Parliamentary complex as Parliament debates the 22nd Amendment to the Constitution today.\n\nA heavy police presence was observed at Polduwa Junction and near the main entrance to the Parliamentary complex.\n\nThe increased security measures come amid a protest organised by the Samagi Jana Balawegaya (SJB) against the proposed 22nd Amendment."
