    "description": "SLT-Mobitel unveils Nutanix powered \u2018Enterprise Premium Cloud\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/SLT-Mobitel-unveils-Nutanix-powered-Enterprise-Premium-Cloud/273-351010",
    "lang": "en",
