    "md5": "7e13ba95acc8c701e34e9099308f871e",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1988,
    "chunk_text": "SLT-Mobitel unveils Nutanix powered \u2018Enterprise Premium Cloud\u2019\n\nRiyaaz Rasheed - CEO, SLT\u2011Mobitel, and Faiz Shakir = VP Sales \u2013 Nutanix, Southern Asia unveil the Premium Cloud\n\nSLT-Mobitel, the enterprise services arm of Sri Lanka Telecom PLC, unveiled the SLT-Mobitel Enterprise Premium Cloud powered by Nutanix at the Lanka Tech Summit 2026, held at ITC Ratnadipa, Colombo recently.\n\nPurpose-built to accelerate digital transformation across Sri Lanka, the Premium Cloud empowers enterprises to modernise IT infrastructure, run mission-critical workloads with greater resilience, and adopt AI-ready capabilities with confidence. Combining hybrid multi-cloud flexibility with enterprise-grade performance, the service enables organisations to strengthen business continuity through seamless disaster recovery, scalable cloud deployments, and enhanced operational agility.\n\nThe launch marks a significant milestone in SLT-Mobitel Enterprise\u2019s multi-cloud journey, reinforcing its commitment to delivering secure, scalable, and future-ready cloud services that enable Sri Lankan businesses to innovate, grow, and compete in an increasingly digital economy.\n\nA key highlight of the launch is SLT-Mobitel Enterprise becoming the first service provider in the region to join the Nutanix Elevate Service Provider Program (NESPP), underscoring its commitment to bringing globally recognised cloud technologies and best practices to Sri Lankan enterprises.\n\nPowered by Nutanix, a global leader in hybrid multicloud computing, the service is built on a unified cloud platform that simplifies infrastructure management while enabling seamless application and data mobility across on-premises environments, public clouds, and edge locations. This collaboration further strengthens SLT-Mobitel Enterprise\u2019s multi-cloud portfolio by combining world-class cloud innovation with local expertise and support, delivering enterprises a resilient, secure, and high-performance cloud experience."
  },
