    "chunk_size_bytes": 1158,
    "chunk_text": "Powered by Nutanix, a global leader in hybrid multicloud computing, the service is built on a unified cloud platform that simplifies infrastructure management while enabling seamless application and data mobility across on-premises environments, public clouds, and edge locations. This collaboration further strengthens SLT-Mobitel Enterprise\u2019s multi-cloud portfolio by combining world-class cloud innovation with local expertise and support, delivering enterprises a resilient, secure, and high-performance cloud experience.\n\nThe introduction of SLT-Mobitel Enterprise Premium Cloud represents an important milestone for the company in expanding its Multi-Cloud portfolio. Built on Nutanix\u2019s globally recognized hybrid multicloud platform and hosted within SLT\u2011Mobitel\u2019s Tier III data centre infrastructure, the newservice delivers enterprise-grade capabilities with unmatched scalability, flexibility, security, and business continuity.\n\nLanka Tech Summit 2026 brought together CIOs, CTOs, technology leaders, and business decision-makers to explore the latest developments shaping hybrid multi-cloud adoption and enterprise digital transformation."
