    "chunk_size_bytes": 1768,
    "chunk_text": "David Pieris Automobiles opens new BAIC showroom in Kandy\n\nRohana Dissanayake - Group Chairman & Managing Director, David Pieris Group together with Ethen, Country Manager, BAIC, Mahesh Gunathilake - Director, DPA and Dhanika de Silva -Director, DPA cutting the ribbon to open new showroom\n\nDavid Pieris Automobiles (Private) Limited (DPA), the four-wheeler automotive arm of the David Pieris Group, has expanded its BAIC showroom network with the opening of its newest showroom in Kandy.\n\nLocated Katugastota Road, Kandy, the new showroom brings BAIC\u2019s range of modern vehicles closer to customers in Kandy and the surrounding areas, further strengthening the brand\u2019s presence in Sri Lanka.\n\nThe opening marks another significant step in DPA\u2019s efforts to expand access to BAIC vehicles across the country, supported by the growing demand for modern, feature-rich and technologically advanced mobility solutions.\n\nThe new Kandy showroom joins BAIC\u2019s existing flagship showroom on Pannipitiya Road, Battaramulla, together with its showrooms in Hyde Park Corner Colombo 02, Kurunegala, Matara, Ratnapura, Jaffna and Ampara. The expanding network enables customers in key regions to conveniently explore BAIC\u2019s vehicle range and receive professional sales assistance.\n\nDavid Pieris Automobiles currently markets three BAIC models in Sri Lanka, catering to a range of customer requirements and preferences.\n\nThe portfolio includes the BAIC X55, a contemporary SUV offering a combination of design, performance, technology and practicality; the BAIC BJ30, a distinctive SUV designed for customers seeking versatility and a bold driving experience; and the BAIC X3e, a fully electric vehicle that reflects BAIC\u2019s commitment to the future of sustainable mobility."
