    "chunk_size_bytes": 1651,
    "chunk_text": "HNB Life unveils \u2018Jeevithayata Piyapath\u2019 brand song\n\nMarking yet another milestone in its 25-year journey, HNB Life officially launched its new brand song, transforming the much-loved jingle from its landmark \u2018Wings for Life\u2019 campaign into a full-length song.\n\nThe song was aired on the grand stage of Voice Teens Sri Lanka, the local edition of the internationally acclaimed entertainment franchise, making it a first-of-its-kind initiative in Sri Lanka\u2019s insurance industry.\n\nThe \u2018Wings for Life\u2019 campaign was introduced earlier this year as part of HNB Life\u2019s transition from HNB Assurance to HNB Life, a historic rebranding that celebrated the company\u2019s evolution over the past 25 years. While the campaign successfully introduced a fresh identity, it was the uplifting melody and message behind the jingle that truly captured hearts across the country.\n\nCommenting on the launch, Lasitha Wimalaratne, Executive Director / Chief Executive Officer of HNB Life said, \u201cThe most enduring brands are those that create genuine emotional connections with people. Our transformation to HNB Life was never just about changing a name or visual identity. It was about strengthening our purpose and deepening our connection with the aspirations of the people we serve. The overwhelming response to the \u2018Wings for Life\u2019 campaign showed us the power of authentic storytelling and inspired us to create something that could continue to live beyond the campaign itself\u201d.\n\nHe further added that in today\u2019s rapidly evolving marketplace, trust, relevance and customer engagement have become critical drivers of long-term business success."
  },
