    "description": "Development banking needs tax relief and sharper aim to take off, says Bingumal Thewarathanthri",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Development-banking-needs-tax-relief-and-sharper-aim-to-take-off-says-Bingumal-Thewarathanthri/273-351021",
