    "chunk_text": "The delegates will arrive on October 4 or early on October 5, with the B2B meetings scheduled for October 6 and familiarisation tours of the Cultural Triangle and other areas on October 7 and 8, before the programme closes on October 9.\n\nWelikala highlighted Sri Lanka\u2019s compactness, which allows the delegates to attend a conference and experience a different climate on the same day, along with its year-round appeal and online visa facilities for 40 countries.\n\n\u201cThis is value for money, not a budget. We provide a good service with competitive rates,\u201d she stressed.\n\nProf. Ranasinghe emphasised that a single large event benefits a wide chain of stakeholders, from airlines, tour operators, venues, photographers to logistics suppliers.\n\n\u201cThis is not just a single business for one or two groups,\u201d he remarked. (NF)"
