    "description": "Fitch upgrade paves way for investment-led growth; DFIs urged to go beyond lending: CB Governor",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Fitch-upgrade-paves-way-for-investment-led-growth-DFIs-urged-to-go-beyond-lending-CB-Governor/245-351027",
