    "chunk_text": "Parliamentary debate on 22nd Amendment begins\n\nColombo, September 24 (Daily Mirror)- The two-day parliamentary debate on the proposed 22nd Amendment to the Constitution commenced a short while ago.\n\nParliament is scheduled to continue the debate tomorrow, with the vote on the proposed amendment expected to take place tomorrow evening.\n\nParliament received the Supreme Court\u2019s determination on the legislation on Tuesday paving the way for the parliamentary debate."
  },
