    "description": "Another Damper for Aussie Dream of Lankans",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Another-Damper-for-Aussie-Dream-of-Lankans/172-351031",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
