    "chunk_size_bytes": 720,
    "chunk_text": "Flood warning for Kuda Ganga extended by 48 hours\n\nColombo, September 24 (Daily Mirror)-\u00a0 The Irrigation Department has extended the flood warning issued for the Kuda Ganga sub-basin of the Kalu River for a further 48 hours.\n\nThe department said the warning, which was initially issued at 9.30 a.m. on September 20, has been extended due to the prevailing conditions in the area.\n\nResidents living in low-lying areas of the Kuda Ganga sub-basin have been urged to remain vigilant and take necessary precautions.\n\nThe Irrigation Department has also advised motorists travelling on roads, particularly secondary and rural routes passing through the affected areas, to exercise extreme caution due to the risk of flooding."
