    "chunk_text": "NPP unity will be clear in 22nd Amendment vote: Harini\n\nColombo, Sep. 24 (Daily Mirror) - Prime Minister Harini Amarasuriya said the unity of the National People\u2019s Power (NPP) parliamentary group would be clearly demonstrated during tomorrow evening\u2019s vote on the 22nd Amendment.\n\nAddressing Parliament, she dismissed reports of divisions within the NPP as false news, stressing that the party remains committed to a common objective.\n\n\u201cWe do not have personal agendas. We have a common objective. Everyone will see the unity of all 158 members tomorrow evening,\u201d she said."
