    "md5": "4397bdd2ce7bd8173a207b2c1d30e8b0",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1765,
    "chunk_text": "LB CIM-Thyaga bring digital gifting services\n\nAs the flagship digital platform of LB Finance PLC, LB CIM continues to evolve beyond traditional digital banking by offering the customers access to a comprehensive ecosystem of financial and lifestyle services through a single mobile application.\n\nIt entered into a strategic partnership with Thyaga, Sri Lanka\u2019s premier digital e-gifting voucher platform, to offer digital gifting services directly through the LB CIM app.\n\nThe partnership was officially launched at a signing ceremony held at LB Finance corporate office, marking another milestone in LB CIM\u2019s journey to evolve beyond traditional financial services into a comprehensive lifestyle ecosystem.\n\nThrough this collaboration, the LB CIM users can seamlessly send personalised digital gift vouchers through the app by entering any preferred gift amount for their friends and loved ones. The recipients can then redeem the gifted value across Thyaga\u2019s network of over 200 partner merchants islandwide, choosing from leading brands spanning fashion, dining, supermarkets, lifestyle and everyday essentials.\n\nThe integration delivers a convenient and flexible digital gifting experience while empowering the recipients with the freedom to choose how and where they use their gift. Through this partnership, both organisations reinforce their shared commitment to leveraging technology to enhance everyday life for people across Sri Lanka.\n\nLB Finance Executive Director Ravi Tissera stated, \u201cAt LB CIM, we are continuously reimagining how digital finance can integrate with daily lifestyle needs. Partnering with Thyaga enables us to extend our ecosystem beyond financial services and deliver real value through improved access to digital gifting.\u201d"
  },
