    "chunk_size_bytes": 997,
    "chunk_text": "The Sri Lanka fund is intended to create a structured channel for capital into listed and private Sri Lankan companies, leveraging complementary deal flow, research and investor networks on both sides of the Palk Strait.\n\n\u201cIndian capital is increasingly looking beyond domestic borders for growth opportunities. Sri Lanka offers an attractive neighbourhood market with improving fundamentals. Pairing the expertise behind our Bharat Transformation Fund with a dedicated Sri Lanka vehicle allows us to serve clients seeking exposure to the island\u2019s listed and private companies through a structured channel,\u201d said Sincere Syndication CEO Sivaramakrishnan R.\n\n\u201cCross-border transactions between India and Sri Lanka involve specific tax, regulatory and structuring considerations. Our role is to help de-risk and accelerate those processes, so that good investment ideas can move from discussion to execution more efficiently,\u201d said Ramesh R. of Avyukthi Consulting & Advisory Services LLP."
