    "md5": "624aff70a87e77b4ab79ccd32c5f4d26",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1927,
    "chunk_text": "Dialog Govi Mithuru and University of Ruhuna Partner to Advance Agricultural Innovation\n\nFrom left: Asanga Priyadarshana, Group Chief Corporate Officer, Dialog Axiata PLC; Senior Prof. P. A. Jayantha, Vice Chancellor, University of Ruhuna; Senior Prof. G. Y. Jayasinghe, Dean, Faculty of Agriculture, University of Ruhuna; Hon. K. D. Lalkantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation of Sri Lanka; Senior Prof. K. L. Wasantha Kumara, Vice Chairman, University Grants Commission; Supun Weerasinghe, Director / Group Chief Executive, Dialog Axiata PLC; and Dr. Romesh Ranawana, Group Chief Analytics and AI Officer, Dialog Axiata PLC.\n\nSenior Prof. P. A. Jayantha, Vice Chancellor of the University of Ruhuna, and Dr. Romesh Ranawana, Group Chief Analytics and AI Officer of Dialog Axiata PLC, exchange the signed Memorandum of Understanding for Govi Mithuru AI at ISAE 2026, in the presence of government officials and representatives of the University of Ruhuna.\n\nDialog Axiata PLC, Sri Lanka\u2019s #1 connectivity provider, together with the University of Ruhuna and Chakra Labs, has entered into a partnership through Dialog\u2019s Govi Mithuru platform to advance agricultural research and innovation, combining academic expertise, digital technology and industry collaboration to develop practical solutions for Sri Lanka\u2019s agriculture sector.\n\nIntroduced in 2015 and endorsed by the Ministry of Agriculture, Govi Mithuru began as a mobile-based agricultural advisory service and was enhanced with AI capabilities in 2025, evolving into Sri Lanka\u2019s first AI-powered agriculture platform. Today, it provides cultivation guidance, weather updates, crop information, market prices, AI-powered chat and voice assistance, pest and disease identification, and agricultural expertise in Sinhala, Tamil and English. The platform can be accessed via the Govi Mithuru app, by dialling 616, or through govimithuru.lk."
  },
