    "chunk_size_bytes": 1247,
    "chunk_text": "The presence of Hon. K.D. Lalkantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, at ISAE 2026 further highlighted the growing role of technology in supporting Sri Lanka\u2019s agriculture sector. The collaboration builds on Govi Mithuru\u2019s journey, extending Dialog\u2019s use of AI and connectivity to support knowledge-driven agricultural solutions.\n\nSupun Weerasinghe, Director / Group Chief Executive of Dialog Axiata PLC, said, \u201cTechnology has the potential to transform how we address some of the most fundamental challenges facing Sri Lanka\u2019s agriculture sector. Through this collaboration with the University of Ruhuna, we are bringing together connectivity, AI and academic expertise to explore practical solutions that can support greater productivity, resilience and sustainability. It reflects our continued commitment to using technology to enrich and empower Sri Lankan lives and contribute meaningfully to the country\u2019s digital future.\u201d\n\nHon. K. D. Lalkantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation of Sri Lanka, joined representatives from Dialog Axiata PLC and the University of Ruhuna at the Govi Mithuru AI showcase during the International Symposium on Agriculture and Environment (ISAE) 2026."
