    "chunk_text": "As part of this transition, Hayleys Mobility has delivered 21 JAECOO J7 Plug-in Hybrid Electric Vehicles (PHEVs) to Jetwing Travels. The vehicles will be deployed across Jetwing Travels and Jetwing Journeys for airport transfers, excursions and extended tours throughout the island.\n\nHasith Prematillake, Managing Director of Hayleys Fentons Limited said, \u201cSustainable mobility must deliver both environmental and commercial value if it is to be adopted at scale. With approximately 90 kilometres of electric-only driving, a combined range of up to 1,200 kilometres and an estimated saving of around Rs. 15 per kilometre compared with petrol-powered driving, the JAECOO J7 PHEV presents a strong proposition for high-mileage fleet operators.\u201d\n\nRajieve Fernando, Chief Executive Officer of Hayleys Mobility Limited added, \u201cHayleys Mobility supports the transition towards more sustainable mobility through a comprehensive mobility ecosystem, bringing together vehicles, charging infrastructure, technical expertise and dependable after-sales care to provide customers with a seamless mobility experience.\u201d"
