    "md5": "927ae405d2986020464cbf611a6ca1e8",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1552,
    "chunk_text": "SLIC Life appoints Dr. Sameera Dharmasena as CEO\n\nSri Lanka Insurance Life (SLIC Life) announced the appointment of Dr. Sameera Dharmasena as its new Chief Executive Officer, effective 22nd September 2026.\n\nDr. Dharmasena is an insurance professional with over 21 years of experience in the Sri Lankan insurance industry, having held senior leadership positions across several leading insurance companies affiliated with some of Sri Lanka\u2019s largest business conglomerates.\n\nHis career spans both local and multinational insurance environments, bringing together broad industry expertise, strategic leadership and a strong commitment to the advancement of the insurance profession.\n\nIn addition to his corporate leadership experience, Dr. Dharmasena has made a significant contribution to the development of insurance education and professionalism in Sri Lanka. He was elected President of the Sri Lanka Insurance Institute, the country\u2019s insurance education body affiliated with the Chartered Insurance Institute (CII), UK. His involvement with the Institute reflects his commitment to strengthening professional knowledge, education and standards within the insurance industry.\n\nDr. Dharmasena holds a PhD in Business Management from Girne American University, an MBA from the University of Colombo, a BSc (Hons) in Biological Science from the University of Kelaniya, and an LLB from the Open University of Sri Lanka. He is also a Fellow of the Chartered Insurance Institute (FCII), UK, and an Associate of the Insurance Institute of India (AIII)."
  },
