    "chunk_text": "\u201cOnline sex is easy, convenient and simple. There is no responsibility towards anyone, and it takes only a few minutes. Men may naturally choose the easier option, which can be a psychological tendency rather than a personal flaw,\u201d the counsellor said.\n\nThey stressed that sexual withdrawal should not automatically be interpreted as a lack of affection or attraction, as it may be associated with stress, emotional difficulties, relationship problems or other personal factors.\n\nCounsellors encouraged couples experiencing persistent difficulties with intimacy to communicate openly and seek professional support when necessary."
