    "description": "64% of pre-schoolers get 30+ minutes of daily screen time in SL, raising concerns - Survey",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/64-of-pre-schoolers-get-30-minutes-of-daily-screen-time-in-SL-raising-concerns-Survey/108-351177",
