    "chunk_text": "Social media users and politicians are currently blaming the Government for not taking action to save Anojan's life; however, addressing such situations is far more complex than simply posting on Facebook."
  },
  {
    "doc_type": "lk_news",
    "doc_id": "2026-09-25-dailyftlk-e783579d",
    "num": "dailyftlk-e783579d",
