    "description": "\u2018Revised\u2019 Protection of State from the Terrorism Bill: What\u2019s changed and what remains",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Revised-Protection-of-State-from-the-Terrorism-Bill-What-s-changed-and-what-remains/4-797767",
