    "chunk_text": "That said, the 159-seat supermajority is an institutional distortion produced by Opposition fragmentation and selective voter turnout, rather than a reflection of an absolute, monolithic national consensus.\n\nOn moral issues there can be no left or right.\u00a0 It is either right or wrong."
