    "description": "Late Lankan elephant Vishva Mali on permanent display at Philippine National Museum",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Late-Lankan-elephant-Vishva-Mali-on-permanent-display-at-Philippine-National-Museum/56-797787",
    "lang": "en",
