    "description": "Sajith says 22nd Amendment creating \u2018black present\u2019",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sajith-says-22nd-Amendment-creating-black-present/56-797797",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
