    "md5": "b21abbf253be3b30116ac42e4395fc00",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 417,
    "chunk_text": "However,\u00a0 after the retrial process, the Colombo Trial-at-Bar\u00a0 sentenced former Inspector General of Police (IGP) to death after finding him guilty on several charges, including criminal dereliction of duty for failing to take action to prevent the Easter Sunday terrorist attacks, despite receiving prior intelligence warnings.\n\nWe the people can only hope the ongoing investigation will help answer this question."
