    "chunk_size_bytes": 564,
    "chunk_text": "As Iran remains defiant, on the sidelines of the UNGA sessions, Trump held a meeting with Middle Eastern leaders without the elephant in the room\u2014Israel. At the UNGA session, some of these leaders, particularly Jordan\u2019s King Abdullah and Turkish President Recep Tayyip Erdogan, made thundering speeches critical of Israel. But fiery speeches count for nothing if they do not walk the talk.\n\nThe new UN Secretary-General, assuming office in January, would do well to inscribe on the podium a simple reminder: \u2018Speak the truth and promote peace and justice.\u2019"
