    "chunk_size_bytes": 510,
    "chunk_text": "SJB mulls no-confidence motion against Speaker\n\nColombo, September 26 (Daily Mirror)- The Samagi Jana Balawegaya (SJB) is considering bringing a no-confidence motion against Speaker Jagath Wickramaratne, SJB General Secretary Ranjith Madduma Bandara said.\n\nSpeaking to Daily Mirror, Madduma Bandara confirmed that the party is contemplating such a move, adding that the motion would be submitted at an appropriate time.\n\nHowever, he did not disclose when the motion would be formally handed over to Parliament."
  },
