    "description": "Regulation or control? NGO Bill puts civic space under scrutiny: TPA\u2019s Barath",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Regulation-or-control-NGO-Bill-puts-civic-space-under-scrutiny-TPAs-Barath/108-351199",
    "lang": "en",
