    "chunk_text": "Navy seizes heroin and ICE in Jaffna raid\n\nJaffna, Sep 27 (Daily Mirror) - The Sri Lanka Navy has seized a cache of suspected heroin and \u201cICE\u201d (crystal methamphetamine) during a special operation at the Kusumanthurai beach area in Madagal, Jaffna early this morning.\n\nThe pre-dawn operation was conducted by naval fleet units and personnel from SLNS Agbo under the Northern Naval Command.\n\nDuring the operation, naval personnel also apprehended one suspect and seized a boat believed to have been involved in the alleged smuggling attempt."
