    "description": "NMSJ urges lawmakers to avoid conflict of interest in proposed 22A",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/NMSJ-urges-lawmakers-to-avoid-conflict-of-interest-in-proposed-22A/108-351221",
    "lang": "en",
