    "description": "From factory floor to global buyer: SLCGE Design Hub could widen door for Sri Lanka\u2019s apparel SMEs",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-factory-floor-to-global-buyer-SLCGE-Design-Hub-could-widen-door-for-Sri-Lanka-s-apparel-SMEs/4-797822",
    "lang": "en",
