    "description": "From queues to competition: Why Sri Lanka must stay the course on fuel market\u00a0reform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/From-queues-to-competition-Why-Sri-Lanka-must-stay-the-course-on-fuel-marketreform/4-797825",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
