    "chunk_text": "Rasamanickam also said that because elected Provincial Councils have not functioned since 2017, by-laws prepared by Municipal Councils since 2018 remain unapproved. He called for a legal mechanism to approve and gazette them without delay.\n\nHe also questioned the legal basis for Prajashakthi structures identifying and prioritising Local Government projects. \u201cMembers of a Prajashakthi committee cannot come in and perform the functions of representatives elected by the people,\u201d he said.\n\nRasamanickam also sought disclosure of central and provincial development allocations to each district and local authority in the North and East in 2025 and 2026, and of vehicles and machinery provided to councils over the past five years."
