    "description": "Storex Renewables partners with Sigenergy to respond to Sri Lanka\u2019s solar policy shift",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Storex-Renewables-partners-with-Sigenergy-to-respond-to-Sri-Lankas-solar-policy-shift/273-351229",
    "lang": "en",
