    "chunk_text": "The activations also created an engaging experience for participants through games and gifts, making the DIMO Care Camp more than just a service initiative. The participants were also encouraged and educated on ways to improve productivity and uplift their livelihoods through better machinery care and informed agricultural practices.\n\nDIMO Executive Director Rajeev Pandithage said, \u201cThe DIMO Care Camp was designed to make trusted technical expertise and after-sales support accessible to tractor owners across the country, regardless of the brand or model they operate. By combining practical support for farming communities with development opportunities for agricultural machinery technicians, DIMO aims to strengthen the wider agriculture ecosystem and contribute to greater productivity and sustainability within the sector.\u201d"
