    "chunk_size_bytes": 665,
    "chunk_text": "Two brothers killed, mother injured in motorcycle crash\n\nColombo, Sep. 28 (Daily Mirror) - Two brothers were killed and their mother was seriously injured after the motorcycle they were travelling on veered off the road and collided with a streetlight pole in the Halabandaragama area on the Madampe\u2013Kuliyapitiya Road this morning (28).\n\nThe accident occurred at around 5:30 a.m., according to police.\n\nThe deceased have been identified as two brothers, aged 17 and 11, residents of Weerakodiyana in Dummalasuriya.\n\nTheir mother, who sustained serious injuries in the crash, was admitted to the Chilaw General Hospital, where she is currently receiving treatment."
  },
