    "chunk_text": "Warrant issued on Chamika Karunaratne for failure to appear before court\n\nColombo, Sep. 28 (Daily Mirror) - Colombo Additional Magistrate Kasun Kanchana Dasanayake today ordered that cricketer Chamika Karunaratne be arrested and produced before court after he failed to appear before court.\n\nThe warrant was issued when a complaint filed by a female pilot seeking maintenance payments for her child was taken up for inquiry and Karunaratne failed to appear before court."
