    "description": "\u2018Rabies control has become a racket\u2019: AWC accuses Health Ministry of neglect",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Rabies-control-has-become-a-racket-AWC-accuses-Health-Ministry-of-neglect/108-351286",
    "lang": "en",
