    "chunk_text": "Three arrested over Baddegama double murder\n\nColombo, Sep. 28 (Daily Mirror) - Three suspects have been arrested in connection with the murder of two individuals in Baddegama yesterday, Police said.\n\nThe suspects were arrested last evening in the Halpathota area for allegedly aiding and abetting the crime. Police also recovered 16.17 grams of heroin and a car from their possession.\n\nThe arrests were made during an investigation launched by the Elpitiya Division Crimes Investigation Bureau after a group travelling in a car allegedly opened fire at another group travelling in a three-wheeler in the Halpathota area of the Baddegama Police Division.\n\nThe suspects, aged 22 and 33, are residents of Kahawatta, Pallebedda and Hikkaduwa.\n\nThey are due to be produced before the Baddegama Magistrate\u2019s Court."
