    "chunk_text": "Opposition in disarray after 22A: Nalinda\n\nColombo, Sep. 28 (Daily Mirror) - The Opposition has been thrown into disarray following the passage of the 22nd Amendment to the Constitution, Health Minister Nalinda Jayatissa said today.\n\nSpeaking to reporters, Jayatissa said the Opposition had lost much of its previous strength, while a serious crisis had also emerged within the Samagi Jana Balawegaya (SJB).\n\n\u201cAlthough they voted together in Parliament on the 22A, the divisions within the Opposition are acute,\u201d he said.\n\nHe said the Opposition had also faced further turmoil following an unsuccessful attempt to stage a protest without a clear political slogan."
