    "description": "Breaking Sri Lanka\u2019s capital market \u2018Chicken-and-Egg\u2019 cycle: Why the time has come to act",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Breaking-Sri-Lanka-s-capital-market-Chicken-and-Egg-cycle-Why-the-time-has-come-to-act/4-797913",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
