    "md5": "e7229c011c34ae515f3140617ba9efef",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1085,
    "chunk_text": "Lanka Aluminium Industries opens 10th retail outlet in Kalutara\n\nLanka Aluminium Industries PLC opened its 10th retail outlet in Nagoda, Kalutara recently.\n\n\u201cOur vision is to enable our customers to be able to access our solutions and services right where they need it. To support this vision, we will continue to expand our retail outlets across the island providing easy access to technical advice, shop drawings, wind load calculations, and other technical services,\u201d said Dinal Peiris \u2013 Chairman, Lanka Aluminium Industries PLC.\n\nIn addition to high-quality aluminium extrusions, the retail outlets also carry general accessories required for the making of doors and windows, all under one roof.\n\n\u201cWith the expanding presence of our fully owned sales outlets across the country, the company\u2019s responsibility and accountability is extended and brought closer to our end-customers through these sales and service centers, which creates empathy with the trade while adhering to our strict corporateethical standards,\u201d added Susantha Paranagama, Head of Retail Development."
  },
