    "chunk_index": 1,
    "language": "en",
    "md5": "53fd017b6a2938593fd8e5301e535f71",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1945,
    "chunk_text": "For customers, this journey is reflected in the everyday choices and experiences Keells continues to create. From farm-fresh produce and prepared food offerings to an expanding range of products, new food experiences and digital innovations such as the Keells Nexus App, the brand continues to evolve around the changing needs of Sri Lankan households. The Nexus ecosystem now connects with 2.9 million members, offering a more personalised and accessible omnichannel experience through relevant promotions, personalised offers and exclusive rewards.\n\nAt the heart of Keells\u2019 freshness journey are the farmers who make it possible. Working with over 4,000 active farmers across 10 collection centres, Keells has built a direct sourcing network that connects agricultural communities with consumers across the country. Through initiatives such as Govi Diriya, farmers receive support in climate-resilient agriculture, sustainable cultivation and Good Agricultural Practices (GAP) certification, along with awareness and precautionary measures to prepare for challenges such as El Ni\u00f1o.\n\nWith over 6,500 employees, the organisation continues to create opportunities through training, career development and wellbeing initiatives. Through partnerships such as NAITA certification, Keells supports employees in building recognised skills and progressing in their careers. This is complemented by initiatives that support employees through different stages of their lives, including leadership development and career growth for women through She Rises, access to mental and social wellbeing support through Peace Pod, and practical guidance on managing personal finances through the Financial Wellbeing Programme.\n\nBecause keeping life fresh is not only about what we bring home. It is about the opportunities we create, the communities we strengthen, the better tomorrow we help build together, and how we inspire everyone to live in a fresh way."
  },
