    "chunk_text": "Discussing the incorporation of Abanchy Africa Limited, Asitha Silva, Group Chairman and Managing Director at Pink Eagle, said \u201cBy establishing our presence in Kenya, we\u2019re reaffirming our commitment to creating a resilient and futureready business group with the potential for competitive growth in new directions. Having established a presence in Africa, our goal is to deliver sustainable value and drive innovation by uniting bold, strategic thinking with a modern, global mindset to pursue excellence in innovation and performance.\u201d\n\n\u201cBy expanding our operation to Kenya, we aim to not only strengthen our international network but to build the foundation for a strong regional presence that combines local market knowledge with the international freight-forwarding expertise, reliable customer service, and integrated logistics solutions that our Group offers,\u201d added Mohamed Asker, General Manager, Abanchy Ceylon.\n\nAbanchy began its African expansion journey in 2024 by establishing a sales office in Ethiopia. With its new chapter in Kenya, the Group is not only expanding its diversified portfolio in new direction and ventures but actively pursuing growth along global pathways to establish a definitive Sri Lankan presence that delivers sustainable growth, empowers communities, and sets new benchmarks on the world stage."
