    "description": "Middle East escalation threatens Sri Lanka on 6 economic fronts: ADB",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-main/Middle-East-escalation-threatens-Sri-Lanka-on-6-economic-fronts-ADB/245-351328",
    "lang": "en",
