    "chunk_size_bytes": 579,
    "chunk_text": "Namal produced before court over \u2018Krrish\u2019 deal\n\nColombo, Sep. 29 (Daily Mirror) - Imprisoned Member of Parliament Namal Rajapaksa was produced before the Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court this morning (29) in connection with an ongoing case related to the controversial \u2018Krrish\u2019 deal.\n\nRajapaksa has been named as the fourth suspect in a case filed by the Commission to Investigate Allegations of Bribery or Corruption (CIABOC) before the Colombo Chief Magistrate\u2019s Court.\n\nHe was brought before court today for further judicial proceedings in connection with the bribery case."
