    "date_str": "2026-09-29",
    "description": "SC Determination on 22A:  A Law and Policy Critique",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/SC-Determination-on-22A-A-Law-and-Policy-Critique/172-351336",
