    "chunk_text": "Flood warnings lifted for four river basins\n\nColombo, Sep. 29 (Daily Mirror) - The Department of Irrigation has lifted the flood warnings issued for four river basins following a return to normal water levels.\n\nThe Hydrology and Disaster Management Division said the warnings issued under notices No. DI/Hydro/103(V), along with flood warnings issued for the relevant river basins, had been withdrawn as water levels had returned to normal.\n\nThe warnings have been lifted for the following river basins:\n\nThe Hydrology and Disaster Management Division said it continues to closely monitor rainfall patterns and river water levels across the country.\n\nIt also said necessary measures are in place to provide advance warnings should a flood situation arise."
