    "description": "India airlifts three tons of anti-TB medicines to Sri Lanka",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/India-airlifts-three-tons-of-anti-TB-medicines-to-Sri-Lanka/56-797938",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1790721277.0,
