    "description": "Sajith accuses Govt., CBSL of using outdated data to mask poverty",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/news/Sajith-accuses-Govt-CBSL-of-using-outdated-data-to-mask-poverty/56-797939",
    "lang": "en",
