    "chunk_text": "When does Karu Jayasuriya ever stop? I have asked myself many times. The answer has always been: \u201cNever!\u201d Just a few days ago, when I called him on what would have been his late daughter Indira\u2019s 50th birthday, he was preparing to travel to Jaffna by train the following day.\n\nWhat could I say to such a man on his birthday? He has blessed us all and, in doing so, acquired much merit. But then again, even so, there are things one must say.\n\nHappy 86th birthday, dear Sir. May you be blessed with good health, peace and strength, and may the protection of the Noble Triple Gem always be with you."
