    "description": "Budget 2027: Time to review tax-free threshold for salaried taxpayers?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Budget-2027-Time-to-review-tax-free-threshold-for-salaried-taxpayers/4-797970",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
