    "md5": "df956b537c97a6a1c876551a9214e973",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1705,
    "chunk_text": "INSEE honours suppliers and partners at \u2018Supplier Excellence Awards\u2019\n\nINSEE recently hosted the \u2018INSEE Supplier Excellence Awards 2026\u2019 at Grandeeza Hotel, Negombo, under the theme \u2018Partnership Beyond Boundaries.\u2019\n\nThe event recognised and celebrated the company\u2019s valued suppliers and business partners for their outstanding performance, contributions, and continued partnership with INSEE.\n\nBringing together suppliers, business partners, and INSEE employees, the event celebrated excellence, collaboration, and shared success. Awards were presented across the large, medium, and small supplier categories, covering production services, general administration services, logistics, transportation, and material handling.\n\nA total of 25 supplier awards and six employee awards were presented. Suppliers received Gold, Silver, and Bronze Performance Excellence Awards, while Special Excellence Awards recognised achievements in innovation, value creation, safety, and sustainability. INSEE employees were also recognised through the Best Supervisor and Best Custodian awards.\n\nEng. Thusith Gunawarnasuriya, CEO of INSEE Lanka said, \u201cThe Supplier Excellence Awards provide an important platform to recognise the partners who support and sustain our operations every day. Strong and trusted supplier relationships are fundamental to the reliability and quality we deliver to our customers and to building a more resilient and responsible construction industry in Sri Lanka. This year\u2019s theme, \u2018Partnership Beyond Boundaries,\u2019 reflects the enduring value we create together, not only through products and services, but also through collaboration and a shared commitment to excellence.\u201d"
  },
