    "chunk_text": "The 65 inch STC General Smart Board features a 4K UHD display, 8GB RAM, 128GB internal storage, Android 16 operating system and a 48MP built-in camera. Designed for educational institutions, training centres, meeting rooms and corporate environments, the Smart Board supports interactive teaching, presentations and digital collaboration.\n\nThe STC General Inverter air-conditioner is designed for household, commercial and institutional applications. Its key features include stabilizer-free operation designed to handle voltage fluctuations between 165V and 285V, along with Flexi 5-in-1 cooling, allowing cooling capacity to be adjusted according to room size and user requirements. The unit also incorporates an anti-mildew function that dries the evaporator coil to help limit bacterial growth.\n\nThe air-conditioner also features 100% copper tubing, corrosion protection measures for indoor and outdoor components, a filter-clean indicator, low refrigerant detection and multiple sensors designed to optimise performance. A dry mode is included for greater comfort during humid weather conditions.\n\nCommenting on the launch, STC Chairman/Managing Director Ravindra Fernando said, \u201cThe expansion of the STC General range is part of our strategy to build a stronger own brand portfolio that responds to the requirements of both institutional and consumer markets. Our focus is on providing reliable products at competitive prices, backed by after-sales support, while expanding into areas such as digital learning, workplace technology and household electrical solutions.\u201d\n\nThe event also included a felicitation ceremony recognising institutions that have maintained longstanding business relationships with STC.\n\nA total of 36 awards were presented to institutional customers, comprising eight Appreciation and Recognition Awards, 10 Overall Best Performer Awards, 10 Long Service Awards and eight Zonal Sales Excellence Awards."
