    "description": "Infomate opens new chapter for SL\u2019s BPM industry with Kurunegala expansion",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Infomate-opens-new-chapter-for-SLs-BPM-industry-with-Kurunegala-expansion/273-351406",
