    "description": "Ceyline Group unveils \u2018Roots for the Future\u2019 national reforestation initiative to mark 40th anniversary",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Ceyline-Group-unveils-Roots-for-the-Future-national-reforestation-initiative-to-mark-40th-anniversary/273-351407",
