    "description": "Channa Wijewardena named Diabetasol\u2019s Brand Ambassador",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/Channa-Wijewardena-named-Diabetasols-Brand-Ambassador/273-351408",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
