    "chunk_size_bytes": 1215,
    "chunk_text": "Q: Do you remember that five officers of the Army Tripoli Platoon were named as suspects in connection with the incident?\n\nQ: I suggest to you that, as Defence Secretary at the time, you directly intervened and gave instructions regarding abductions and disappearances.\n\nQ: Is the witness saying that there were operations by persons in the security forces involving abductions and disappearances?\n\nA: Gotabaya Rajapaksa: \u201cWhat I am saying, Your Honour, is that I was not involved in any operation. I functioned as a civilian. I did not give instructions in any way regarding other matters. I did not have the authority to do so.\u201d\n\nQ: In addition to serving as Defence Secretary, you served as President of the country from 2019 to 2022, correct?\n\nQ: As Defence Secretary and subsequently as President, you were aware of abductions and disappearances in this country, weren\u2019t you?\n\nA: Gotabaya Rajapaksa: \u201cYour Honour, those were matters presented with the intention of gaining political advantage. There is no truth in them. Those things were said with the intention of damaging the reputation of the country and gaining political advantage.\u201d\n\nFurther evidence is scheduled to be recorded on November 27."
