    "description": "Digital technology to be integrated into schools: Deputy Minister",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Digital-technology-to-be-integrated-into-schools-Deputy-Minister/108-351463",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
    "time_ut": 1790760183.0,
