    "chunk_text": "Government working on several relief packages: Nalinda\n\nColombo, Sep. 30 (Daily Mirror) - Health Minister Nalinda Jayatissa said today that the Government is discussing several relief packages to be provided to the people while maintaining economic stability.\n\nSpeaking to reporters, Jayatissa said the Government would provide relief without compromising economic stability, adding that President Anura Kumara Dissanayake is expected to announce the measures in his Budget speech on October 12.\n\nHe said the Government was managing the economy amid external shocks arising from tensions in the Middle East.\n\nThe Minister also said the Government had already taken steps to provide relief ahead of the Budget, including the fuel subsidy."
