    "description": "Storex Renewables partners world\u2019s no. 1 Sigenergy to answer Sri Lanka\u2019s solar policy shift",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Storex-Renewables-partners-world-s-no-1-Sigenergy-to-answer-Sri-Lanka-s-solar-policy-shift/34-798017",
