    "description": "Budget 2027 to be presented on 12 Nov.; final vote on 14 Dec.",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/Budget-2027-to-be-presented-on-12-Nov-final-vote-on-14-Dec/34-798019",
    "lang": "en",
