    "chunk_size_bytes": 612,
    "chunk_text": "The investment is expected to directly benefit more than 830,000 people, with close to two million people reached across eight target districts. The investment is also expected to create roughly 5,671 new or improved jobs in reconstruction and maintenance activities, and benefit close to 22,000 tea, vegetable, and paddy farmers by reconnecting them to buyers and supply chains.\n\nThe project is aligned with the World Bank Group\u2019s Country Partnership Framework for Sri Lanka for 2026\u20132030, which identifies resilient infrastructure and connectivity as foundations for recovery and private sector-led growth."
