    "chunk_text": "In a video message, while congratulating the new executive committee, BOI Chairman Duminda Hulangamuwa said the industry\u2019s vertical integration is a strategic advantage. \u201cWe have integrated vertically, with fabric and accessories manufacturers supplying the entire value chain,\u201d he said. He added that the BOI aims to work closely with FAAMA to raise local sourcing from where it\u2019s at currently and will meet the new committee soon to expedite this.\n\nThe office bearers for 2026/27 are Husni Salieh of Noyon Lanka Ltd., as Chairman; Niroshan Samarasinhe of Stretchline Ltd., and Shahid Sangani of Dynawash Ltd., as Vice Chairmen; Shehan Olegasageram of Compreli Consulting Ltd., as Secretary; and Suranga Gallage of Antler Fabric Printers Ltd., as Treasurer.\n\nThey will be joined on the Executive Committee by Janaka Nanayakkara of Teejay Lanka PLC, Harin Gabriel of American & Efird Ltd., Jonah Goh of Best Pacific Textiles Lanka Ltd., Beauno Fernando of Shore to Shore Ltd., Ruwan Mudalpath of Ocean Lanka Ltd., Yasantha Suriyapperuma of Wilkins Spence Packaging Lanka Ltd., and Vasu Wijegoonawardane of Prym Intimates Lanka Ltd."
