    "description": "Sri Lanka Customs goes paperless from today",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/Sri-Lanka-Customs-goes-paperless-from-today/108-351489",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
