    "md5": "35589178c8a4425f82127726b14e7aa4",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1913,
    "chunk_text": "Softlogic Life pioneers AI-powered corporate reporting\n\nSoftlogic Life has once again raised the bar for corporate reporting in Sri Lanka with the launch of its 2025 annual report, themed \u2018BIG MOVES, BIG IMPACT\u2019, introducing Sri Lanka\u2019s first five-part artificial intelligence (AI)-powered intelligence ecosystem designed to make corporate information smarter, simpler and more accessible to all stakeholders.\n\nThe new ecosystem brings together AI-Optimised Annual Intelligence Report, \u2018Lifey\u2019 Predictive Intelligence Analyser, Adaptive Intelligence Engine, Annual Report Audio Intelligence and Stakeholder Sentiment Intelligence.\n\nThe AI-Optimised Annual Intelligence Report has been designed for a world in which the investors, analysts, researchers and other stakeholders increasingly use AI assistants, large language models and digital financial platforms to discover and analyse corporate information. Through an open, industry-standard connection using Model Context Protocol, external AI systems can connect directly with the annual report and retrieve verified information from the source.\n\nLifey, Softlogic Life\u2019s Predictive Intelligence Analyser, takes stakeholder engagement beyond conventional search. The users can interact with the annual report by typing or speaking questions and receive clear, contextual responses that can also be read aloud.\n\nThe Adaptive Intelligence Engine changes the traditional concept of a one-size-fits-all annual report by allowing the stakeholders to create a version tailored to their own requirements.\n\nAnnual Report Audio Intelligence extends accessibility beyond the written report by transforming key financial, strategic and sustainability information into a series of AI-generated audio episodes. Available in 10 languages, the feature allows the stakeholders to engage with Softlogic Life\u2019s performance and strategic direction wherever they are."
  },
