    "chunk_text": "Seylan Bank Head of Cards Ruchith Liyanage said, \u201cAt Seylan Bank, we understand that the customers often plan significant purchases around the year-end season and our 36-month zero percent easy payment plan is designed to give them greater flexibility and convenience in managing these expenses. Whether the customers are upgrading their homes, investing in lifestyle essentials or planning other important purchases, Seylan Cards remains committed to supporting their financial convenience through solutions that put their needs first.\u201d\n\nThe customers who wish to make use of the offer can make the eligible purchases between October 01 and December 31, 2026 and convert transactions ranging from Rs.100,000 to Rs.3 million into a 36-month easy payment plan.\n\nTo convert an eligible transaction, the customers can contact 011 2008888. The customers who do not currently hold a Seylan credit card can also apply by contacting the same hotline."
