    "description": "Will any leader undo the 22A in future?",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Will-any-leader-undo-the-22A-in-future/172-351511",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
