    "chunk_text": "SLFUW Celebrates  85th Anniversary\n\nSLFUW President Eng. Lakmini Nonis, Chief Guest Prof. Emeritus Niranjanie Ratnayake, Council Members & other guests at the anniversary celebrations\n\nThe festive commemorative cake was cut jointly by\u00a0 chief guest Prof. Ratnayake and Dr. Premala Sivaprakasapillai\u00a0 Sivasegaram, the first female engineer of Sri Lanka\n\nThe Sri Lanka Federation of University Women celebrated its historic 85th Anniversary on Saturday September 19, 2026, at its Headquarters on Kithulwatte Road, Colombo. The Auditorium was filled to capacity as SLFUW President\n\nEng. Lakmini Nonis, welcomed the assemblage, which included distinguished professionals and academics.\n\nSubsequently, Prof. Emeritus Niranjanie Ratnayake, the chief guest, initiated proceedings by lighting the traditional oil lamp.\n\nThe festive commemorative cake was cut jointly by\u00a0 chief guest Prof. Ratnayake and Dr. Premala Sivaprakasapillai\u00a0 Sivasegaram, the first female engineer of Sri Lanka. Then followed the presentation of eight scholarships to female undergraduates, including two who were visually impaired.\n\nIn her address, President Nonis stated that the SLFUW\u00a0 assisted not only university women, but also school education in\u00a0 underprivileged areas, with special focus on the socially disadvantaged. Besides, it also helped alleviate poverty, and uplift the lot of the common people. She hoped that this legacy of patriotic service would be carried forward during the next 85 years as well. Finally, she paid tribute to the late Mrs. Clara Motwani, American educationist, who set up the SLFUW in 1941.\n\nThe day\u2019s programme included a panel discussion on\u00a0 \u2018Honouring Traditions, and Building a Sustainable Future for the Next Era of the SLFUW.\u2019 The panelists were, Eng. Premala Sivasegaram Ph.D, Ms. Dinali Fernando, Head, Dept. of English, Kelaniya University, and Snr. Prof. Kumudu Perera of the Wayamba University. Compere Ms. Ayeshah Bansajayah\u00a0 served as Moderator."
