    "chunk_text": "Open warrant issued for Gnanasara Thera\n\nColombo, Oct. 1 (Daily Mirror) - The Court of Appeal today issued an open warrant for the arrest of Ven. Galagodaaththe Gnanasara Thera after he failed to appear before court for the second consecutive day in connection with contempt of court proceedings.\n\nThe Court ordered that the warrant be executed through the Inspector General of Police (IGP).\n\nThe two-judge bench comprised Justices Mayadunne Corea and Lakmali Karunanayake.\n\nCourt directs counsel to advise Gnanasara Thera to appear in another contempt case\n\nGnanasara Thera absent in court: Decision on warrant at noon"
