    "chunk_text": "TV cameraman arrested over alleged assault on Ranil\u2019s security officer\n\nColombo, Oct. 1 (Daily Mirror) - A television cameraman has been arrested in connection with the alleged assault of a security officer attached to former President Ranil Wickremesinghe\u2019s security detail.\n\nThe officer was admitted to the National Hospital in Colombo yesterday after he was allegedly struck on the head with a camera during an incident near the entrance to the Colombo Fort Magistrate\u2019s Court.\n\nThe officer had lodged a complaint with the Slave Island Police regarding the incident.\n\nThe alleged assault took place as Wickremesinghe was leaving the court following a hearing in a case filed over allegations of misusing state funds.\n\nRanil\u2019s security officer hospitalised following alleged assault by video journalist"
