    "chunk_size_bytes": 526,
    "chunk_text": "Brother of underworld figure \u2018Loku Patty\u2019 shot dead in Ahungalla\n\nColombo, Oct. 1 (Daily Mirror) - A man identified as the brother of notorious underworld figure \u2018Loku Patty\u2019 was shot dead by an unidentified gunman in the Welikanda area of Ahungalla this evening (1), police said.\n\nThe victim, Lanthuwahandhi Sugath Nuwan Kumara de Silva, was shot at around 8.10 p.m. using a 9mm pistol, according to police.\n\nPolice confirmed that the victim was the brother of the organised criminal figure known as \u2018Loku Patty\u2019."
