    "description": "Child protection in Sri Lanka: Root causes, scale, response, and the case for reform",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/opinion/Child-protection-in-Sri-Lanka-Root-causes-scale-response-and-the-case-for-reform/14-798081",
    "lang": "en",
