    "description": "New \u2018Ayubo\u2019 lottery makes poor fund free healthcare for all: Advocata",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/New-Ayubo-lottery-makes-poor-fund-free-healthcare-for-all-Advocata/34-798099",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
