    "description": "$ 1 m guarantee cap holds back Sri Lankan builders in Africa",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/business/1-m-guarantee-cap-holds-back-Sri-Lankan-builders-in-Africa/34-798102",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailyftlk",
    "time_ut": 1790908279.0,
