    "description": "Investment climate: Sri Lanka cannot afford mixed signals",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/opinion/Investment-climate-Sri-Lanka-cannot-afford-mixed-signals/172-351577",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
