    "chunk_text": "\u201cThat is a fundamental change in how we think about renewable energy.\u201d\n\nGoonewardena said success depends on a regulatory framework that is practical, transparent and commercially sustainable, with clear standards for metering, grid connection, safety and payment.\n\n\u201cThe technology is becoming available. The industry is preparing. What\u2019s needed now is the vision to connect policy, technology and private investment around a shared national purpose.\u201d\n\nGunda Power is a wholesale solar equipment provider based in Sri Lanka. The company imports and supplies solar equipment to professional installers across the country, supporting the growth of renewable energy through its installer network."
