    "chunk_text": "Complementing this, the HMD 102 4G brings a touch of modern style to the segment, combining all core 4G features with a sleek rounded design, a smartphone-inspired camera module with rear camera and LED flash, auto call recording, and practical daily utilities making high-quality 4G hardware accessible across every budget.\n\nThe 101 4G and 102 4G represent the threshold of the 4G feature phoneportfolio and are held to the same standard as everything above them. Furthermore, Dialog Axiata puts them within the reach of customers in every part of the country.\u201d Gayan Wijethilaka, Country Head for Sri Lanka, Nepal, and Singapore at HMD, said, \u201cCustomers choose these phones for the same reasons they always have; they are simple, durable, and built to last.\n\nWith the addition of 4G, calls are crystal clear, ensuring the device remains reliable for years to come.\u201d Lim Li San, Group Chief Operating Officer of Dialog Axiata PLC, said, \u201cAs Sri Lanka transitions to newer network technologies, we believe better connectivity should be within reach of customers from all walks of life.\n\nThrough our partnership with HMD, we are making 4G more affordable and accessible through smart device options, in line with our commitment to help more Sri Lankans enjoy clearer calls and reliable connectivity every day.\u201d"
