    "chunk_text": "LOLC Life Assurance appoints COO Jayantha Kalinga as Principal Officer\n\nLOLC Life Assurance Ltd. has officially announced the appointment of its Chief Operating Officer (COO), Jayantha Kalinga, as the company\u2019s Principal Officer, in addition to his current executive responsibilities.\n\nThe appointment, made pursuant to formal approval from the Insurance Regulatory Commission of Sri Lanka (IRCSL), further reinforces the Company\u2019s leadership structure and governance framework as it advances its growth trajectory within Sri Lanka\u2019s life insurance sector.\n\nA distinguished industry veteran with over 35 years of comprehensive experience spanning both the Life and General Insurance sectors, Kalinga brings extensive expertise in sales management, distribution network expansion, business development and strategic direction to his expanded portfolio. Throughout his career across leading insurance institutions in Sri Lanka, he has established a proven track record of driving sustained business performance, cultivating high-performing teams, and building customer-centric insurance propositions.\n\nIn his ongoing capacity as Chief Operating Officer of LOLC Life Assurance Ltd., Kalinga plays a pivotal role in steering the Company\u2019s operational and commercial strategies while accelerating its market development. His appointment as Principal Officer underscores the Board\u2019s confidence in his leadership acumen, operational depth, and acute understanding of the evolving dynamics within the regional insurance landscape."
