    "chunk_size_bytes": 596,
    "chunk_text": "\u2018Caution\u2019 level heat alert issued for 13 districts\n\nColombo, Oct. 2 (Daily Mirror) - The Department of Meteorology has issued a \u2018Caution\u2019 level heat alert for 13 districts covering the Northern, North-Central and Eastern Provinces, as well as Moneragala, Hambantota and Ratnapura, for today (2).\n\nThe Met Department said the heat index, the temperature felt by the human body, is expected to reach ''Caution'' levels in some areas of the affected Provinces and districts during the daytime.\n\nThe public has been advised to remain cautious of the effects of increased daytime temperatures."
